    {
      "bbox": [
        290,
        1262,
        1597,
        1507
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "During the course of the legislative session, the City's Legislative Representative in Albany, Victor F. Condello, acting on my behalf, will refer pending bills to appropriate City departments and agencies for their detailed analysis and recommendations in accordance with the following standard procedure.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2379,
          "min": -1.2938
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 51,
          "mean": -0.0004,
          "min": -0.0191
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 38330,
        "area_px": 322582,
        "density": 0.11882,
        "chars": 306,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 7.98
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        290,
        1547,
        1556,
        1794
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Attached to this memorandum are sample copies of a standard NYC Form 55 and 56 which are prescribed for use in reporting on all pending State legislation. Form NYC 55 will be used for reporting recommended approvals. Form NYC 56 will be used for reporting recommended disapprovals. Complete instructions for their preparation appear on the forms.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1791,
          "min": -1.3285
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 70,
          "mean": -0.0011,
          "min": -0.07
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 45597,
        "area_px": 316250,
        "density": 0.14418,
        "chars": 346,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 7.59
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        286,
        1832,
        1658,
        2037
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Consistent with the policy of my recent directive to you, in which I emphasized the need to think along lines of \"necessity and economy\", I particularly urge you to report promptly and fully on any legislative proposals which would either mandate City expenditures or curtail revenues.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2395,
          "min": -1.2159
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 54,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0025
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 36259,
        "area_px": 283797,
        "density": 0.12776,
        "chars": 285,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 7.86
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        284,
        2077,
        1658,
        2284
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Strict adherence to the established procedure for the preparation and submission of reports on pending bills is essential to the attainment of our paramount objectives in the Legislature: defeating all proposed state laws which would be detrimental to the City; advocating the passage of beneficial legislation.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2226,
          "min": -1.38
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
